    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "A. Delta AirLines\nWORLDWIDE TIMETABLE\nEffective April 6, 1997\nGo\nwww.delta-air.com\nNow you can book a domestic\nticket through our SkyLinks web site. What's more, booking\nthrough SkyLinks lets you earn bonus SkyMiles.® Check for the\nlowest available fare. Choose an aisle or window seat. Review flight\narrivals, departures and schedules worldwide. And even keep\nup-to-date with your SkyMiles account. All at the click of a mouse.",
      "Man's Desire Has Always\nBeen To Fly Unassisted...\n...But Until That Time, We Would\nLike To Help You Take Flight With\nThe MC/SkyMiles Program.\nJust join the MCI/SkyMiles program from Delta Air Lines and soon\nyou'll be flying high! Each MCI® service you use adds SkyMiles® to\nyour account. AND, you can earn up to 8,000 miles just for joining!\nSo, don't waste time, your wings are waiting!\nEARN SKYMILES SIX DIFFERENT WAYS!\nMCI Long Distance\nBonus: 2,000 Miles\nPlus 5 miles per dollar spent\nMCI Cellular *\nBonus: 5,000 Miles**\nPlus 5 miles per dollar spentt\nMCI Paging®\nBonus: 500 Miles*\nPlus 5 miles per dollar spent™\nMct intern\n118 086 234-3244\nMCI Card®\nEarn:\n5 miles per dollar spent\nSecond Line Home Fax\nBonus: 500 Milest\nPlus 5 miles per dollar spent™\nMCI Internet®\nEarn:\n5 miles per dollar spent*\nFor more information on the MCI/SkyMiles program\nCall: 1-888-MCI-DELTA\nA.Delta AirLines\nMCI\nSkyMiles®\n** For new MCI customers only 5,000 Cellular Bonus Miles are only available for customers who switch their existing cellular\nservice to MCI Cellular. Cannot be combined with other cellular equipment offers.\n*500 Paging Bonus Miles does not apply to\nlocal numeric paging. Credit card required to secure pager against loss theft or damage.\n11500 SkyMites bonus is limited to three\nadditional residential lines.\nMileage credits are based on MCI usage, net of taxes, credits, and discounts. Does not include\nequipment leasing and purchase costs, roaming and landline charges, and activation fee, if any. Other terms apply. Only available\nwith \"MCI On The Go\" and \"MCI Communicator\" plans. Cellular service is available in certain areas.\nAll standard Delta SkyMiles program rules and conditions apply. ©1997, MCI Telecommunications Corporation. All rights reserved."
    ],
